 "title": "The first-order root against the exact root",
 "caption": "The positive root of x² + εx − 1 = 0 is x ≈ 1 − ε/2 for small ε. At ε = 0.1 the approximation gives 0.95 and the exact root is 0.9512; the two curves part company only as ε grows.",
