  "For ε = 0 the root is 1.",
  "The first-order approximation 1 − ε/2 is a straight line.",
  "The exact root (−ε + √(ε² + 4))/2 is a curve that leaves the line only slowly.",
  "At ε = 0.1 the approximation is 0.95 and the exact root is 0.9512."
